# Captures — NEVER commit live traffic. HAR/session dumps carry real
# credentials, cookies, and PII. The redaction layer protects *reports*,
# not raw captures. Keep captures out of the repo entirely.
*.har
*.network-response
*.network-request
captures/
scratch/

